(5805748, 845393, 105457, '<td valign="top">I love the colours on this one, and it''s a perfect take on the subject, nobody thought of it :)<br/>Great lighting use (shame of the shadow on the wall), and very good definition.<br/>I wish the condom could be more visible, but it''s a picture that doesn''t need explanation :-P<br/> <br/>Congratulations!</td>', 'I love the colours on this one, and it''s a perfect take on the subject, nobody thought of it :)Great lighting use (shame of the shadow on the wall), and very good definition.I wish the condom could be more visible, but it''s a picture that doesn''t need explanation :-P Congratulations!', '2010-01-11 06:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805752, 845305, 105130, '<td valign="top">Not voting as, well, I''m the model and wouldn''t want to sway the voting! Nice idea, and very well executed. Just hope it''s not too subtle for the DPC voters.</td>', 'Not voting as, well, I''m the model and wouldn''t want to sway the voting! Nice idea, and very well executed. Just hope it''s not too subtle for the DPC voters.', '2010-01-11 06:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805766, 846207, 105457, '<td valign="top">Waaay too much HDR on this one. You could have made it a b&amp;w, something more natural. I love HDR, but where you can see that it is hdr. The halos around the car are very strong.</td>', 'Waaay too much HDR on this one. You could have made it a b&w, something more natural. I love HDR, but where you can see that it is hdr. The halos around the car are very strong.', '2010-01-11 06:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805767, 846262, 105457, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit of a snapshot. If the goal was to portrait rotten fruit, I think a closeup would be more interesting.</td>', 'Seems a bit of a snapshot. If the goal was to portrait rotten fruit, I think a closeup would be more interesting.', '2010-01-11 06:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805771, 846053, 105457, '<td valign="top">Too extreme on the tonemapping. The car was already damaged, in my opinion could be toned down, as is too much hdr on it.<br/>It is a great perspective, a very interesting subject, but the processing is too much.</td>', 'Too extreme on the tonemapping. The car was already damaged, in my opinion could be toned down, as is too much hdr on it.It is a great perspective, a very interesting subject, but the processing is too much.', '2010-01-11 06:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805774, 846116, 105457, '<td valign="top">Too much tonemapping. The focus is perfect and the definition is very good, but the processing overdone it.</td>', 'Too much tonemapping. The focus is perfect and the definition is very good, but the processing overdone it.', '2010-01-11 06:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805775, 845401, 105457, '<td valign="top">You didn''t need that much tonemapping on this image, it''s too extreme. The colours are cool, but the processing draws the attention <i>out</i> of the picture.</td>', 'You didn''t need that much tonemapping on this image, it''s too extreme. The colours are cool, but the processing draws the attention out of the picture.', '2010-01-11 06:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805776, 846295, 105457, '<td valign="top">Too much Topaz (I think?). The idea was well thought of, but the details enhancer just gave too much crispiness to the picture.</td>', 'Too much Topaz (I think?). The idea was well thought of, but the details enhancer just gave too much crispiness to the picture.', '2010-01-11 06:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805777, 846203, 105457, '<td valign="top">The subject is a little out of focus, and the white balance could use a tweaking.<br/>Other than that, it looks a bit of a snapshot. It would be cool though if shot from below, and with higher shutter speed (increasing the ISO perhaps).</td>', 'The subject is a little out of focus, and the white balance could use a tweaking.Other than that, it looks a bit of a snapshot. It would be cool though if shot from below, and with higher shutter speed (increasing the ISO perhaps).', '2010-01-11 06:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805778, 846263, 105457, '<td valign="top">Interesting... DNMC, but an interesting composition, and it works in a very good abstract.</td>', 'Interesting... DNMC, but an interesting composition, and it works in a very good abstract.', '2010-01-11 07:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805779, 846073, 105457, '<td valign="top">The crop seems a bit too tight, I think it''s because of the sun above?<br/>the upper half is too dark, maybe it could be shot from closer / above, so we could see what it is.</td>', 'The crop seems a bit too tight, I think it''s because of the sun above?the upper half is too dark, maybe it could be shot from closer / above, so we could see what it is.', '2010-01-11 07:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805781, 846088, 105457, '<td valign="top">Great that you''ve managed to incorporate the characters in the background as they were inside the tractor. Unfortunately, the tonemapping is too extreme, the halos in the wheels and tractor are really showing, it could be toned down a bit.</td>', 'Great that you''ve managed to incorporate the characters in the background as they were inside the tractor. Unfortunately, the tonemapping is too extreme, the halos in the wheels and tractor are really showing, it could be toned down a bit.', '2010-01-11 07:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805783, 846230, 105457, '<td valign="top">Good use of framing, in my screen is a little underexposed, probably could be improved by some dodge and burn.</td>', 'Good use of framing, in my screen is a little underexposed, probably could be improved by some dodge and burn.', '2010-01-11 07:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805784, 845857, 105457, '<td valign="top">I would have contrasted the picture a little more, it just seems a bit flat. It would had punch to it.</td>', 'I would have contrasted the picture a little more, it just seems a bit flat. It would had punch to it.', '2010-01-11 07:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805786, 845315, 105457, '<td valign="top">Needs more contrast. I would use the sky as a guide to achieve the maximum white.</td>', 'Needs more contrast. I would use the sky as a guide to achieve the maximum white.', '2010-01-11 07:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805791, 846065, 105457, '<td valign="top">Lensbaby?<br/>A little underexposed, could be brighter, just to have the separation from the knife and the background.</td>', 'Lensbaby?A little underexposed, could be brighter, just to have the separation from the knife and the background.', '2010-01-11 07:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805792, 845798, 105457, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus and underexposed. Maybe could be brightened a bit and sharpened.</td>', 'A little out of focus and underexposed. Maybe could be brightened a bit and sharpened.', '2010-01-11 07:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805794, 846012, 105457, '<td valign="top">The HDR is just too much. Because of the processing the image is vignetting a lot. This is common in HDR, and although the subject is interesting, the shadow bothers me.</td>', 'The HDR is just too much. Because of the processing the image is vignetting a lot. This is common in HDR, and although the subject is interesting, the shadow bothers me.', '2010-01-11 07:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805854, 846308, 105457, '<td valign="top">A bit abstract, I don''t know exactly where to focus on the image.</td>', 'A bit abstract, I don''t know exactly where to focus on the image.', '2010-01-11 08:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
