(5808459, 846173, 45672, '<td valign="top">Oh man, this could have been a real home run.  I''m afraid you over did the post processing here, but you definitely captured a terrific subject.  I would love to see the original photo.  Nice work otherwise.  Next time try to not go as far on the post processing side.  My rule a thumb (for what it''s worth) is go as far as you feel you like and then come back a few notches towards neutral and then it''s about right.  :)</td>', 'Oh man, this could have been a real home run.  I''m afraid you over did the post processing here, but you definitely captured a terrific subject.  I would love to see the original photo.  Nice work otherwise.  Next time try to not go as far on the post processing side.  My rule a thumb (for what it''s worth) is go as far as you feel you like and then come back a few notches towards neutral and then it''s about right.  :)', '2010-01-12 23:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
