(5811336, 846031, 32011, '<td valign="top">I love this sculpture in Sydney.  Parked near it when in Sydney last and visiting The Rocks.  There''s a lot here in this image that takes the viewer away from the subject, to the detriment of the image.  Perhaps a shallower DOF might have helped, or a different angle to eliminate some of the objects in the background.  I like the details and the colours you''ve got with the capture and processing.  <br/> <br/>Not voting yet... will come back later.</td>', 'I love this sculpture in Sydney.  Parked near it when in Sydney last and visiting The Rocks.  There''s a lot here in this image that takes the viewer away from the subject, to the detriment of the image.  Perhaps a shallower DOF might have helped, or a different angle to eliminate some of the objects in the background.  I like the details and the colours you''ve got with the capture and processing.   Not voting yet... will come back later.', '2010-01-14 07:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811359, 846269, 81362, '<td valign="top">A bit underexposed, but interesting red glow behind him.</td>', 'A bit underexposed, but interesting red glow behind him.', '2010-01-14 08:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811360, 846151, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good B&amp;W conversion.</td>', 'Good B&W conversion.', '2010-01-14 08:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811361, 846314, 81362, '<td valign="top">Image conveys theme well. "Forgotten" in title makes me expect something dull and dusty instead of shiny/polished (but I try to ignore titles in challenges).</td>', 'Image conveys theme well. "Forgotten" in title makes me expect something dull and dusty instead of shiny/polished (but I try to ignore titles in challenges).', '2010-01-14 08:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811366, 845693, 81362, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and tones. Should score well.</td>', 'Excellent detail and tones. Should score well.', '2010-01-14 08:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811367, 846297, 81362, '<td valign="top">Objects captured well - not easy with mostly light tones. Hard to get the boken dreams idea from the image itself; maybe if the ring no longer worn on a finer were displayed alone on the table surface it would connect more immediately to the topic. Will come back after voting ends to read your details.</td>', 'Objects captured well - not easy with mostly light tones. Hard to get the boken dreams idea from the image itself; maybe if the ring no longer worn on a finer were displayed alone on the table surface it would connect more immediately to the topic. Will come back after voting ends to read your details.', '2010-01-14 08:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811368, 846138, 81362, '<td valign="top">Processing choice pushes this into a graphic art area. Would be interesting to see version as the camera saw it.</td>', 'Processing choice pushes this into a graphic art area. Would be interesting to see version as the camera saw it.', '2010-01-14 08:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811370, 846317, 81362, '<td valign="top">The bright white spaces between the pieces ake on an aspect of bing objects like ribbons. Would be fun to see this with the red lable changed to black to make it more of an abstract.</td>', 'The bright white spaces between the pieces ake on an aspect of bing objects like ribbons. Would be fun to see this with the red lable changed to black to make it more of an abstract.', '2010-01-14 08:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811371, 846033, 81362, '<td valign="top">Will be interesting to check your detail notes to see how many times you had to drop these to get them to stay well positioned.</td>', 'Will be interesting to check your detail notes to see how many times you had to drop these to get them to stay well positioned.', '2010-01-14 08:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811373, 846311, 81362, '<td valign="top">Looks like a sculpture that should be ina modern art museum.</td>', 'Looks like a sculpture that should be ina modern art museum.', '2010-01-14 08:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811374, 846140, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good detail and nice reflections.</td>', 'Good detail and nice reflections.', '2010-01-14 08:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811375, 846163, 81362, '<td valign="top">Looks like it got a lot of use (wear on the main stem from being picked up). Light provides good definition of form, but it would be stronger against an uncluttered background.</td>', 'Looks like it got a lot of use (wear on the main stem from being picked up). Light provides good definition of form, but it would be stronger against an uncluttered background.', '2010-01-14 08:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811376, 845975, 81362, '<td valign="top">If I scroll down to hide the sky, this image really comes to life.</td>', 'If I scroll down to hide the sky, this image really comes to life.', '2010-01-14 08:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811379, 846203, 81362, '<td valign="top">Breaking chair is a good concept. Having a non-wood floor might allow the chair more visibility. Adjusting white balance to reduce the yellow color cast and faster shutter/sharper focus would be good, as would a different choice of clothes for the model (the narrow boot fur and the band of skirt color first made me wonder if the model might be tied to the chair).</td>', 'Breaking chair is a good concept. Having a non-wood floor might allow the chair more visibility. Adjusting white balance to reduce the yellow color cast and faster shutter/sharper focus would be good, as would a different choice of clothes for the model (the narrow boot fur and the band of skirt color first made me wonder if the model might be tied to the chair).', '2010-01-14 08:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811380, 846270, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good light. Usually having the horizon line tilted comes across as a flaw, but it seems to fit in this case.</td>', 'Good light. Usually having the horizon line tilted comes across as a flaw, but it seems to fit in this case.', '2010-01-14 08:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811566, 845315, 89230, '<td valign="top">The top of this is much more bright than the bottom of it. Maybe next time a graduated highlight layer (or filter) would help even it out.</td>', 'The top of this is much more bright than the bottom of it. Maybe next time a graduated highlight layer (or filter) would help even it out.', '2010-01-14 11:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811570, 846049, 89230, '<td valign="top">fantastic!! My only wish would be to crop in a bit tighter, but that could be difficult with this specific photo.</td>', 'fantastic!! My only wish would be to crop in a bit tighter, but that could be difficult with this specific photo.', '2010-01-14 11:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811572, 846268, 89230, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I think this wouldve been slightly better had the car been facing into the photo. A simple flip horizontal would accomplish this (er, I think...).</td>', 'Great photo. I think this wouldve been slightly better had the car been facing into the photo. A simple flip horizontal would accomplish this (er, I think...).', '2010-01-14 12:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811575, 846217, 89230, '<td valign="top">This is... um, well, I think it woulve been more of a BAM if there wasnt texture on the white surface. Nice!!</td>', 'This is... um, well, I think it woulve been more of a BAM if there wasnt texture on the white surface. Nice!!', '2010-01-14 12:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5811576, 845952, 89230, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. However, my preference (and I think thats all it would be) would be to have more of a crop on your main subject, the watch.</td>', 'This is a great photo. However, my preference (and I think thats all it would be) would be to have more of a crop on your main subject, the watch.', '2010-01-14 12:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
