(5816243, 846178, 90495, '<td valign="top">Don''t you hate that smell the disc makes after cooking it. yuk! Maybe you didn''t smell it though after only 1 second. This definitely doesn''t work as it once did. lol My 6 didn''t help you much. :( Now go and try cooking it for 20 seconds, ooo ooo that smell...</td>', 'Don''t you hate that smell the disc makes after cooking it. yuk! Maybe you didn''t smell it though after only 1 second. This definitely doesn''t work as it once did. lol My 6 didn''t help you much. :( Now go and try cooking it for 20 seconds, ooo ooo that smell...', '2010-01-18 00:10:20.000000', NULL, 0),
