(5816251, 846295, 104230, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sarampo:</b></div><hr/><i> Too much Topaz (I think?). The idea was well thought of, but the details enhancer just gave too much crispiness to the picture. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comment... I thought this style was appropriate since the bagel (and everything else we tried to toast for that matter) was "done to a crisp" !!</td>', 'Originally posted by sarampo: Too much Topaz (I think?). The idea was well thought of, but the details enhancer just gave too much crispiness to the picture.   Thanks for the comment... I thought this style was appropriate since the bagel (and everything else we tried to toast for that matter) was "done to a crisp" !!', '2010-01-18 00:14:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5816254, 845393, 32108, '<td valign="top">Very well done - congrats:)</td>', 'Very well done - congrats:)', '2010-01-18 00:16:12.000000', NULL, 0),
