(5816276, 846295, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought your treatment was perfect and I thought this would have finished higher.  We had something like that except it caught things on fire!  lol   Good shot.</td>', 'I thought your treatment was perfect and I thought this would have finished higher.  We had something like that except it caught things on fire!  lol   Good shot.', '2010-01-18 00:31:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5816279, 846049, 67697, '<td valign="top">Excellent find, Urfa.  What an interesting scene.  Congrats on your second ribbon!</td>', 'Excellent find, Urfa.  What an interesting scene.  Congrats on your second ribbon!', '2010-01-18 00:32:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5816286, 846074, 67697, '<td valign="top">Since you can''t ride a 5D, I guess you ought to put it to good use, eh?  Clever idea.  Love the tones as usual.  Congrats on the posthumous!  You are getting to be a ribbon hog :)</td>', 'Since you can''t ride a 5D, I guess you ought to put it to good use, eh?  Clever idea.  Love the tones as usual.  Congrats on the posthumous!  You are getting to be a ribbon hog :)', '2010-01-18 00:36:01.000000', NULL, 0),
