(5816405, 846170, 15407, '<td valign="top">I too had one of thes fine lenses'' yet the fishbowl effect got the better od it... looks like any of the home cures I was aware of don''t work very well....when I''ve find the extra$ I''ll send it to Nikon to be refurbished as there is a dried up scum on the glassworks inside! Damn I hate it when this sort of thing happens!!!</td>', 'I too had one of thes fine lenses'' yet the fishbowl effect got the better od it... looks like any of the home cures I was aware of don''t work very well....when I''ve find the extra$ I''ll send it to Nikon to be refurbished as there is a dried up scum on the glassworks inside! Damn I hate it when this sort of thing happens!!!', '2010-01-18 04:04:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5816409, 846268, 15407, '<td valign="top">IT''s a great old chevy with a lot of potential to be restored into a fine old vehicle.  I''m curiouse to know what the car is to it''s immediate left...Perhaps a Nash or a Kaiser? Do tell if you know!<br/></td>', 'IT''s a great old chevy with a lot of potential to be restored into a fine old vehicle.  I''m curiouse to know what the car is to it''s immediate left...Perhaps a Nash or a Kaiser? Do tell if you know!', '2010-01-18 04:10:30.000000', NULL, 0),
