(5816543, 846049, 97893, '<td valign="top">Urfa you are such a delightful photographer.<br/> <br/>Love, what you have captured here. It is very interesting when things unfold themselves before you, as happened these kids made the perfect scene and setting for you.<br/>God is Graceful!<br/> <br/>A very well deserving ribbon too! Enjoy!</td>', 'Urfa you are such a delightful photographer. Love, what you have captured here. It is very interesting when things unfold themselves before you, as happened these kids made the perfect scene and setting for you.God is Graceful! A very well deserving ribbon too! Enjoy!', '2010-01-18 08:58:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5816573, 844654, 103142, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful shot! I try not to say, "I don''t know why this didn''t rate higher." but, "I don''t know why this didn''t rate higher!!" I like it very much.</td>', 'What a wonderful shot! I try not to say, "I don''t know why this didn''t rate higher." but, "I don''t know why this didn''t rate higher!!" I like it very much.', '2010-01-18 09:30:26.000000', NULL, 0),
