(5816655, 846063, 90495, '<td valign="top">Nice antique. I would have lit it from the top to avoid the shadows. I like the zero keys. Keep up the good work and be patient, the ribbons will come with experience. :)</td>', 'Nice antique. I would have lit it from the top to avoid the shadows. I like the zero keys. Keep up the good work and be patient, the ribbons will come with experience. :)', '2010-01-18 10:32:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5816656, 846012, 90495, '<td valign="top">This had to ribbon or else.... congrats on a fine image. :)</td>', 'This had to ribbon or else.... congrats on a fine image. :)', '2010-01-18 10:33:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5816657, 845975, 61651, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jdannels:</b></div><hr/><i> Photos like this make me feel like I am slacking off. very nice Steve. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What he said. <br/> <br/>The presentation is unbearably evocative, it leaves the viewer as gutted as the subject.  The interplay between the passing wisp of cloud and the foreground composition is genius, and necessary.</td>', 'Originally posted by jdannels: Photos like this make me feel like I am slacking off. very nice Steve.   What he said.  The presentation is unbearably evocative, it leaves the viewer as gutted as the subject.  The interplay between the passing wisp of cloud and the foreground composition is genius, and necessary.', '2010-01-18 10:33:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5816664, 845922, 90495, '<td valign="top">Fail.  As in?<br/> <br/>Although I do not agree with this capturing the challenge theme I think it''s a great image and well captured with the long exposure. I actually think the fishermen intentionally left the boat there. I''m sure the men and their boat left once the tide came in. Is this the case? The reason I say so is that there''s way too much gear on that boat for it to be abandoned.<br/> <br/>Congrats.</td>', 'Fail.  As in? Although I do not agree with this capturing the challenge theme I think it''s a great image and well captured with the long exposure. I actually think the fishermen intentionally left the boat there. I''m sure the men and their boat left once the tide came in. Is this the case? The reason I say so is that there''s way too much gear on that boat for it to be abandoned. Congrats.', '2010-01-18 10:39:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5816666, 846049, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yay yay YAY!!!!  I did not have time to look through this challenge - I am SO pleased that his did well!  You have a lovely sense of the real world in your work.  CONGRATULATIONS!!!!</td>', 'Yay yay YAY!!!!  I did not have time to look through this challenge - I am SO pleased that his did well!  You have a lovely sense of the real world in your work.  CONGRATULATIONS!!!!', '2010-01-18 10:42:32.000000', NULL, 0),
