(5816789, 845686, 101668, '<td valign="top">Great Shot. There is a farm near Clarens called Noord Brabant. The name always fascinated me and now I know where it comes from. The owner must have been from Hollandish descend. If I recall correctly his surname was Cilliers.</td>', 'Great Shot. There is a farm near Clarens called Noord Brabant. The name always fascinated me and now I know where it comes from. The owner must have been from Hollandish descend. If I recall correctly his surname was Cilliers.', '2010-01-18 12:58:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5816817, 846049, 98022, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Congrats on the yellow!</td>', 'Great shot! Congrats on the yellow!', '2010-01-18 13:20:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5816840, 846306, 69684, '<td valign="top">I still don''t know why this one ended so low. I like the light and the subject. Perhaps it''s because the horizon isn''t horizontal, but that''s just a guess.</td>', 'I still don''t know why this one ended so low. I like the light and the subject. Perhaps it''s because the horizon isn''t horizontal, but that''s just a guess.', '2010-01-18 13:59:48.000000', NULL, 0),
