(6427010, 846263, 106233, '<td valign="top">Nice picture! <br/>I like the balance between the vibrant colors and the dark house with the blurred naked trees. Looks like some fight between good and evil...<br/>Considering the date of the picture and the title, i think that any DNMC thoughts were unfair. This image deserved a better place on the challenge, definitely.<br/>I would just crop a little on the right to put the house more to the rule of thirds, but no big deal.<br/>Congrats!</td>', 'Nice picture! I like the balance between the vibrant colors and the dark house with the blurred naked trees. Looks like some fight between good and evil...Considering the date of the picture and the title, i think that any DNMC thoughts were unfair. This image deserved a better place on the challenge, definitely.I would just crop a little on the right to put the house more to the rule of thirds, but no big deal.Congrats!', '2011-05-29 00:30:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6474922, 845686, 62187, '<td valign="top">Yeah, you should quit...you got some really cruddy photos anyway. I should know...I quit at least 3 times already and my photos are way cruddier then yours...we don''t have things like this train here in Las Vegas anymore. They did when I was a kid. It was fun to play on them. I wonder what happened to them?</td>', 'Yeah, you should quit...you got some really cruddy photos anyway. I should know...I quit at least 3 times already and my photos are way cruddier then yours...we don''t have things like this train here in Las Vegas anymore. They did when I was a kid. It was fun to play on them. I wonder what happened to them?', '2011-07-19 00:38:10.000000', NULL, 0);
